OL,3,GNEWSAControversial dual role of
OL,4,AScotland's top law officers to be
OL,5,Areviewed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe controversial dual role of
OL,8,FScotland's top law officers are to be
OL,9,Fexamined as part of an independent
OL,10,Freview, First Minister John Swinney has
OL,11,Fannounced.
OL,13,FThe lord advocate and solicitor general
OL,14,Fare Scotland's chief prosecutors, as
OL,15,Fwell as holding ministerial positions
OL,16,Fas legal advisers to the government.
