OL,3,GNEWSAControversial dual role of
OL,4,AScotland's top law officers to be
OL,5,Areviewed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThat has led to concerns about
OL,8,Fpotential conflicts of interest,
OL,9,Fincluding earlier this year during the
OL,10,Fprosecution of former SNP chief
OL,11,Fexecutive Peter Murrell. Former Lord
OL,12,FAdvocate Dorothy Bain was criticised
OL,13,Ffor briefing Swinney about the case.
OL,15,FLaw officers have consistently stressed
OL,16,Ftheir independence from all political
OL,17,Fconsiderations.
